{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"十年春王二月，公會齊侯、鄭伯于中丘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"夏，翬帥師會齊人、鄭人伐宋。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"六月壬戌，公敗宋師于菅。辛未，取郜。辛巳，取防。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"秋，宋人、衛人入鄭。宋人、蔡人、衛人伐戴。鄭伯伐取之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"冬十月壬午，齊人、鄭人入郕。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"十年春，王正月，公會齊侯，鄭伯于中丘。癸丑，盟于鄧，為師期。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"夏五月，羽父先會齊侯、鄭伯伐宋。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"六月戊申，公會齊侯、鄭伯于老桃。壬戌，公敗宋師于菅。庚午，鄭師入郜。辛未，歸于我。庚辰，鄭師入防。辛巳，歸于我。君子謂：「鄭莊公於是乎可謂正矣。以王命討不庭，不貪其土以勞王爵，正之體也。」","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"蔡人、衛人、郕人不會王命。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"秋七月庚寅，鄭師入郊。猶在郊，宋人、衛人入鄭。蔡人從之伐戴。八月壬戌，鄭伯圍戴。癸亥，克之，取三師焉。宋、衛既入鄭，而以伐戴召蔡人，蔡人怒，故不和而敗。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"九月戊寅，鄭伯入宋。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_10_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_10","textTraditional":"冬，齊人、鄭人入郕，討違王命也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}